{'symbol': 'SNPS', 'date': '2021-06-01 11:10:00', 'title': 'SYNOPSYS NAMED A LEADER IN THE 2021 GARTNER MAGIC QUADRANT FOR APPLICATION SECURITY TESTING FOR FIFTH CONSECUTIVE YEAR', 'text': 'MOUNTAIN VIEW, CALIF., JUNE 1, 2021 /PRNEWSWIRE/ --\xa0SYNOPSYS, INC. (NASDAQ:\xa0SNPS), TODAY ANNOUNCED IT\xa0HAS BEEN\xa0NAMED BY GARTNER, INC.\xa0AS A LEADER IN THE "MAGIC QUADRANT FOR APPLICATION SECURITY TESTING" FOR THE FIFTH CONSECUTIVE YEAR.1 IN THE\xa0REPORT, GARTNER\xa0EVALUATED 14 APPLICATION SECURITY TESTING VENDORS BASED ON THEIR COMPLETENESS OF VISION AND ABILITY TO EXECUTE.'}{'symbol': 'SNPS', 'date': '2021-06-01 09:05:00', 'title': "SYNOPSYS DESIGNWARE IP ACHIEVES BROAD INDUSTRY ADOPTION WITH MULTIPLE FIRST-PASS CUSTOMER SILICON SUCCESSES ON TSMC'S N5 PROCESS", 'text': "MOUNTAIN VIEW, CALIF., JUNE 1, 2021 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- SYNOPSYS, INC.\xa0(NASDAQ:\xa0SNPS) TODAY ANNOUNCED THAT ITS BROAD DESIGNWARE® INTERFACE, LOGIC LIBRARY, EMBEDDED MEMORY AND PVT MONITOR IP SOLUTIONS HAVE ENABLED CUSTOMERS TO ACHIEVE MULTIPLE FIRST-PASS SILICON SUCCESSES ON TSMC'S N5 PROCESS, ACROSS MORE THAN 20 LEADING SEMICONDUCTOR COMPANIES."}